            <td>Official 2027 COLA National Announcement (Oct 14, 2026)</td>
            <td><a href="https://www.ssa.gov/news/en/advocates/2026-10-14.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cc-link">ssa.gov/news/en/advocates/2026-10-14.html ↗</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="cc-row-alt">
            <td>Social Security Administration (SSA)</td>
            <td>Official SSA Social Security Blog (Oct 14, 2026)</td>
            <td><a href="https://www.ssa.gov/blog/en/posts/2026-10-14.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cc-link">ssa.gov/blog/en/posts/2026-10-14.html ↗</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Social Security Administration (SSA)</td>
            <td>Official Cost-of-Living Adjustment (COLA) Information Portal</td>
            <td><a href="https://www.ssa.gov/cola/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cc-link">ssa.gov/cola ↗</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="cc-row-alt">
            <td>Bureau of Labor Statistics (BLS)</td>
            <td>Consumer Price Index for Urban Wage Earners and Clerical Workers (CPI-W)</td>
            <td><a href="https://www.bls.gov/cpi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cc-link">bls.gov/cpi ↗</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Centers for Medicare &amp; Medicaid Services (CMS)</td>
            <td>Medicare Part B Premiums and Deductibles Portal</td>
            <td><a href="https://www.medicare.gov/basics/costs/medicare-costs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cc-link">medicare.gov/basics/costs/medicare-costs ↗</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="cc-row-alt">
            <td>Internal Revenue Service (IRS)</td>
            <td>IRS Publication 915 (Social Security and Equivalent Railroad Retirement Benefits)</td>
            <td><a href="https://www.irs.gov/forms-pubs/about-publication-915" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cc-link">irs.gov/pub-915 ↗</a></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="cc-independence">
      Seniors Audit is an independent educational publisher. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to the Social Security Administration, BLS, CMS, or IRS. All calculations execute entirely in your web browser using published federal formulas and official announcements. No financial figures or personal identifiers are collected, stored, or transmitted.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       RELATED TOOLS
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="cc-section" aria-labelledby="related-heading">
    <h2 id="related-heading">Other Free Decision Tools You May Find Useful</h2>
    <div class="cc-related-grid">

      <a href="/social-security/social-security-cola-2027/" class="cc-related-card">
